OL,3,GNEWSAPolice seek help over woman's body
OL,4,Aleft in bin bag
OL,5,
OL,6,FDetectives have appealed for help
OL,7,Fidentifying a murdered pensioner whose
OL,8,Fbody was found in a bin bag in a park.
OL,10,FThe woman, who was white and believed
OL,11,Fto be in her 70s, was found dead in
OL,12,FStanley Park, Liverpool, shortly before
OL,13,F17:30 BST on Friday. She was wearing a
OL,14,Fcerise pink Nike t-shirt and was
OL,15,Fdescribed as about 5ft 2in (1.6m) tall,
OL,16,Fsmall build and with strawberry blonde
OL,17,Fhair.
OL,23,APub: 31-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,407,400,260,160,0,100
