OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,-. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,,
OL,3,GNEWSAPolice seek help over woman's body
OL,4,Aleft in bin bag
OL,5,
OL,6,FDet Supt Rachel Wilson from Merseyside
OL,7,FPolice said it was "a shocking crime"
OL,8,Fand they believed the woman's body may
OL,9,Fhave been left in the black bag at a
OL,10,Fwalled garden for a number of weeks.
OL,12,FShe said a post mortem examination took
OL,13,Fplace on Saturday but the result had
OL,14,Fbeen withheld for investigation
OL,15,Freasons.
